Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho, heave-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.20,0:00:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Satoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.80,0:00:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll catch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.44,0:00:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go, \Nhuuuuug!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.08,0:00:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I could easily climb down on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave-ho, heave-ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If only you'd just fall in love with me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.40,0:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.56,0:00:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you made it down safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It would've been better \Nif you fell so I could catch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.84,0:00:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.50,0:00:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
